RMT_NAME^수취인명^40^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
			</TRAN>
			<TRAN name="obtss_elbs_129r" title="타행이체수취조회(지로/예약/자?" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="345" _ulen="261" >

MNRC_BANK_CODE^입금은행코드^3^0^0^0^0^0^0
JOB_TRNO^작업단말번호^39^0^0^0^0^0^0
MNRC_ACNO^입금계좌번호^20^0^0^0^0^0^0
TR_AMT^거래금액^19^0^7^0^0^0^0
